WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.317
Before you sign a life, health or savings policy,

2
00:00:03.411 --> 00:00:07.520
some questions deserve an answer, in plain words and in writing.

3
00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:11.127
What exactly it covers, and what not.

4
00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:14.412
Whether there are waiting periods before any cover starts.

5
00:00:14.715 --> 00:00:17.187
What applies to conditions you already have.

6
00:00:17.374 --> 00:00:20.055
And for how many years the cover lasts.

7
00:00:21.155 --> 00:00:22.757
What the premium is today,

8
00:00:22.757 --> 00:00:25.496
and how it changes over the years or with age.

9
00:00:25.799 --> 00:00:27.621
What happens if you stop paying.

10
00:00:27.808 --> 00:00:30.697
And in savings plans, what the charges are,

11
00:00:30.884 --> 00:00:35.097
what is guaranteed and what is not, and what you get if you stop early.

12
00:00:36.197 --> 00:00:38.971
Answer the health questions fully and accurately:

13
00:00:39.343 --> 00:00:42.013
an omission can cost you at claim time.

14
00:00:42.385 --> 00:00:46.088
Find out who the beneficiaries are and how to change them,

15
00:00:46.147 --> 00:00:48.456
whether there is a period to change your mind,

16
00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:51.162
and keep a copy of everything you signed.

17
00:00:52.262 --> 00:00:54.537
You do not need to decide on the day.

18
00:00:54.665 --> 00:00:58.681
Take the proposal with you and think it over in your own time.

19
00:00:59.781 --> 00:01:03.240
The checklist “What to ask before I sign”

20
00:01:03.299 --> 00:01:08.244
is free on farazisgiannis.com, with no sign-up and no e-mail.
